2 types of package structure

1. packaging by layer - controller, services, repository / DAO, model
example - User, Movie, Ticket  entities

controller
    /UserController
    /MovieController
    /TicketController

service
    /UserService
    /MovieService

2. packaging by feature - big companies follows this structure as a feature is that big
keep all classes related to a feature / entity together

example - User, Movie, Ticket  entities

user

    /UserController
    /UserService
    /UserRepo
    /User

movie
    /MovieController
    /MovieService
    /MovieRepo
    /Movie

